Modifications made in this fork (per Apache License 2.0, Section 4b)
-------------------------------------------------------------------

Added:
  * On-device translation of manga pages: ML Kit text recognition, translation
    backends (Google, DeepL, Lingva, MyMemory), an overlay that draws results
    pinned to the page, a rubber-band area selector, and a word/phrase lookup
    panel. Source: app/src/main/java/mihon/feature/translate/
  * Migration helper that detects other Mihon-family apps and imports their
    backup files selectively. Source: app/src/main/java/mihon/feature/migratefromapp/
  * Reader additions: adjustable page-turn tap zones, webtoon auto-detection.

Modified:
  * Application name ("MangaLens"), application ID ("app.mangalens") and the
    launcher icon, so this fork is distinct from the official app and installs
    alongside it. No Mihon branding is used.
  * Reader classes, settings screens and dependency wiring were extended to
    host the features above. The affected upstream files are listed in
    .agent/context/fork-vs-upstream.md.

