English word list (app/src/main/assets/english_words.txt)

Derived from the dwyl/english-words project (https://github.com/dwyl/english-words),
released into the public domain under the Unlicense. Filtered to ASCII alphabetic
entries of 2-20 characters; no other modification.

Used offline to tell a real English word from a misread one. The recognizer's
mistakes on comic lettering are systematic, so nothing about the shape of a
garbled word reveals it — only knowing that no such word exists.

