PP-OCRv5 English recognition model (app/src/main/assets/paddle_rec_en.onnx,
paddle_rec_en_dict.txt)

From PaddleOCR (https://github.com/PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR), Apache License 2.0.
ONNX conversion redistributed by https://huggingface.co/monkt/paddleocr-onnx,
also Apache License 2.0. Unmodified.

Used for on-device English text recognition where the bundled ML Kit model
misreads hand-lettered comic fonts.
